<title>USA: Whittaker still talking to potential buyers.</title>
<headline>Whittaker still talking to potential buyers.</headline>
<dateline>SIMI VALLEY, Calif. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whittaker Corp said Tuesday it is still in talks with potential buyers of the company and potential buyers of its communications, defense electronics and aerospace units.</p>
<p>Whittaker said in a statement it was responding to queries from the New York Stock Exchange which asked it to comment on recent market activity in its shares.</p>
<p>Shares of Whittaker were 2-1/4 higher at 13-3/4 in afternoon trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
